#---
# purpose: "A thousand sequential calls sum their results"
# oracle: oracle.exs
# oracle.stamp: 48ff04704426824f
#---
#
# Every result stays live until the sum, so the body is cut into a thousand
# resume steps that each hold every result before them. The steps run in one
# frame, so the native code and stack stay proportional to the calls.
def f(x), do: x + 1

